.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt MK.TEST.MK 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mk.test.mk
.Nd unit tests with ATF and Kyua
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Builds and runs a module's tests.
Compiled tests link ATF and the module's own output; all are registered in a
generated Kyuafile and run with
.Xr kyua 1 .
.Pp
Not included directly by a makefile.
.Ss Variables
.Bl -tag -width "TESTS_CXX"
.It Va TESTS_C
Test programs with atf-c, from
.Pa tests/ Ns Ar name Ns Pa .c .
.It Va TESTS_CXX
Test programs with atf-c++, from
.Pa tests/ Ns Ar name Ns Pa .cpp .
.It Va TESTS_SH
Scripts with atf-sh, from
.Pa tests/ Ns Ar name Ns Pa .sh .
.It Va TEST_LINK
What a test links:
.Cm library ,
the default, the built library;
.Cm objects ,
the module's objects, to reach internals a library does not export.
.It Va TEST
Only this test.
One no module declares is an error.
.It Va KYUA
The Kyua to run.
Default
.Pa kyua .
.El
.Pp
Set the lists before the
.Ic .include
of
.Xr mk.lib.mk 5
or
.Xr mk.prog.mk 5 .
.Ss Targets
.Bl -tag -width "test"
.It Cm test
Build what the tests need, and run them.
With
.Va REPORT=yes ,
an HTML report too.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "build/KEY/runs/RUN_ID/test-results.xml"
.It Pa tests/
sources
.It Pa build/ Ns Ar KEY Ns Pa /tests/
the programs and Kyuafile
.It Pa build/ Ns Ar KEY Ns Pa /runs/ Ns Ar RUN_ID Ns Pa /test-results.xml
JUnit results, always written
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Non-zero if any test failed.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
LIB=geo
TESTS_CXX=raster_test
TEST_LINK=objects
\&.include <mk.lib.mk>
.Ed
.Pp
.Dl $ bmake test TEST=raster_test REPORT=yes
.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
.Bl -diag
.It TEST= Ns Ar name : no such test declared in Ar module
Check the name.
.It TEST_LINK= Ns Ar value : expected library or objects
A bad value.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr bmake-it 7 ,
.Xr kyua 1 ,
.Xr mk.atf.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.crosstest.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.lib.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.prog.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.tst.mk 5
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Sylvain Souche
